sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PR as Pull request
    participant M as main
    participant D as deploy (tf-apply-qa@)
    participant A as cmdb-aggregate
    participant O as cmdb-observed
    participant P as cmdb-publish
    participant R as release cmdb-latest
    PR->>PR: cmdb generate + check (no cloud)
    PR->>PR: G1: contract · sensitive outputs<br/>comment: blast radius
    PR->>M: merge with the declared half
    M->>D: push to main
    loop each changed stack
        D->>D: tofu apply
        D->>D: tofu show -json · tofu output -json<br/>drops sensitive · > 1 KiB → sha256
        D-->>A: artifact observed/<id>.json
    end
    Note over A: concurrency: cmdb-write
    A->>O: commit with the runId · push (rebase and retry)
    Note over O: a push to this branch does not trigger deploy
    A->>P: needs
    P->>M: reads the declared half
    P->>O: reads the observed half
    P->>R: index.json · graph.jsonld
